CREDITS & THIRD-PARTY ASSETS
============================

All 3D models and textures used in this demo are released under CC0
(public domain dedication). Attribution is not required but we
acknowledge the authors here.

Models
------

- Quaternius (quaternius.com) — Textured LowPoly Trees, Ultimate Buildings
  Pack, Ultimate Nature Pack, Medieval Village Props, RPG Characters.
  All available on OpenGameArt.org under CC0 1.0 Universal.

- GrEmlin / OpenGameArt — Seamless grass texture (grass_55.png), CC0.

- Kenney (www.kenney.nl) — Mini Characters, Fantasy Town Kit,
  Modular Buildings, Nature Kit (CC0). Not currently used in the
  active demo build but included in the assets directory.

Tools
-----

- FBX2glTF by Facebook/Meta — BSD-3-Clause license.
  Used to convert Quaternius FBX assets to glTF 2.0.

- process_gltf.py (custom script in tools/) — converts glTF 2.0 to the
  custom .skl binary format used by libskel.so.

For the full asset procurement and conversion log, see MODELS.md.
